== Q1: cost of a process vs a thread ==

measurement                                   value
fork() + _exit() + waitpid()                39890.1 us
pthread_create() + pthread_join()             660.1 us
pipe round trip (2 switches, 2 copies)         39.5 us
RSS growth for 256 live thread stacks          7040 kB
  -> resident bytes per thread stack           27.5 kB
(each thread touched 64 kB of its stack; created 256)

process/thread creation cost ratio: 60.4 x
